ns":[{"id":"shaodi-m-o128-shaodi-p0118","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["shaodi-q-o128"]},{"id":"wgc-m-o034-shaodi-p0118","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及全怿","evidence":["wgc-q0027"]},{"id":"wgc-m-o036-shaodi-p0118","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及全怿","evidence":["wgc-q0029"]},{"id":"wgc-m-o086-shaodi-p0118","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及全怿","evidence":["wgc-q0067"]},{"id":"wgc-m-p033-shaodi-p0118","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及全怿","evidence":["wgc-q0114"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chenghuang-q-0cf97fa905c953017d83","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-8df1d46a00b273a6bbbc","layer":"original","quote":"太平二年，〔魏大将军诸葛诞据寿春来降，〕魏人围之。遣朱异、唐咨等往救，复使奉与黎斐解围。奉为先登，屯于黎浆〖10〗；力战有功，拜左将军","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":358,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":67},{"id":"feipin-q-6d61eca1778d51ea073f","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-133fdadf2671af7b34a3","layer":"original","quote":"及魏大将诸葛诞以寿春来附，而全怿、全端、全祎、全仪等，并因此际降魏；全熙谋泄见杀：由是诸全衰弱。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":113,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":48},{"id":"hequan-q-471873efe3c73342b238","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-7d40498a2406c90a8f04","layer":"original","quote":"救诸葛诞于寿春，出城先降。魏以为平东将军，封临湘侯","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":148,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":18,"end":43},{"id":"santizhu-q-a805fae656d71ba8f345","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-dc57a9e53d35b30f8168","layer":"original","quote":"三月，司马文王克寿春；诞及左右战死，将吏以下皆降。","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":119,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":16,"end":41},{"id":"santizhu-q-c64e28841e3e0e9c447b","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-42b7e8e5ba14bda04d7d","layer":"original","quote":"十二月，全端、怿等，自寿春城诣司马文王〖17〗。","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":96,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":21,"end":45},{"id":"santizhu064-q-4ee6b68e68a3fac3ca3f","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-390d7a804c8a1bdac217","layer":"original","quote":"魏大将军诸葛诞举寿春叛，保城请降。吴遣文钦、唐咨、全端、全怿等帅三万人救之。魏镇南将军王基，围诞〖1〗，钦等突围入城","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":439,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":58},{"id":"shaodi-e-o128a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b41ba43f7aca70555e83","layer":"original","quote":"冬十二月，吴大将全端、全怿等率众降〖38〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":533,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":22},{"id":"shaodi-e-o129a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b1abcd215d0c852fc17c","layer":"original","quote":"三年春二月〖1〗，大将军司马文王陷寿春城，斩诸葛诞。三月，诏曰：“古者克敌，收其尸以为京观〖2〗，所以惩昏逆而彰武功也。汉孝武元鼎中〖3〗，改桐乡为闻喜〖4〗，新乡为获嘉〖5〗，以著南越之亡〖6〗。大将军亲总六戎〖7〗，营据丘头〖8〗；内夷群凶〖9〗，外殄寇虏〖10〗；功济兆民，声振四海。克敌之地，宜有令名〖11〗：其改‘丘头’为‘武丘’。明以武平乱，后世不忘；亦京观、二邑之义也〖12〗”。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":575,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":197},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-6209c552405e0ebbdf98","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-6209c552405e0ebbdf98","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：甘露二年（公元 257 ）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":535,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-4dd98e402a6a8de51491","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"shaodi-q-o117","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-d021e0b00f489a01f208","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月〖1〗，青龙现温县井中。三月，司空卢毓薨。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":522,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26},{"id":"shaodi-q-o128","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b41ba43f7aca70555e83","layer":"original","quote":"冬十二月，吴大将全端、全怿等率众降〖38〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":533,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":22},{"id":"wgc-q0027","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-3e0f9aeb5d0f62e60b75","layer":"original","quote":"吴人大喜，遭将全怿、全端、唐咨、王祚等，率三万众，密与文钦俱来应诞。以诞为左都护，假节，大司徒〖8〗，骠骑将军，青州牧，寿春侯。是时镇南将军王基始至，督诸军围寿春，末合。咨、钦等从城东北，因山乘险，得将其众突入城。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":174,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":107},{"id":"wgc-q0029","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-415a96152140983fb9ca","layer":"original","quote":"吴将朱异再以大众来迎诞等，渡黎浆水〖1〗；泰等逆与战，每摧其锋。孙綝以异战不进〖2〗，怒而杀之。城中食转少，外救不至，众无所恃。将军蒋班、焦彝，皆诞爪牙计事者也；弃诞，逾城自归大将军〖3〗。﹝一﹞大将军乃使反间，以奇变说全怿等〖4〗；怿等率众数千人，开门来出。城中震惧，不知所为。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":140},{"id":"wgc-q0067","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-19a57525c37bf4f5767a","layer":"original","quote":"甘露二年，征诸葛诞为司空。时，会丧宁在家〖1〗，策诞必不从命，驰白文王。文王以事已施行，不复追改。﹝一﹞及诞反，车驾住项；文王至寿春，会复从行。初，吴大将全琮，孙权之婚亲重臣也〖2〗；琮子怿、孙静、从子端、翩、缉等，皆将兵来救诞。怿兄子辉、仪留建业，与其家内争讼；携其母，将部曲数十家渡江，自归文王。会建策，密为辉、仪作书，使辉、仪所亲信，赍入城告怿等，说“吴中怒怿等不能拔寿春，欲尽诛诸将家，故逃来归命”。怿等恐惧，遂将所领，开东城门出降，皆蒙封宠，城中由是乖离。寿春之破，会谋居多。亲待日隆，时人谓之子房〖3〗。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":455,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":258},{"id":"wgc-q0114","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-fa99abaef1f673ce3780","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《汉晋春秋》曰：“文钦曰：‘蒋班、焦彝，谓我不能出而走；全端、全怿，又率众逆降：此敌无备之时也，可以战矣！’诞及唐咨等皆以为然，遂共悉众出攻。”","attribution":"汉晋春秋","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":213,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-73682a57dcb31fcf32f5","start":0,"end":75},{"id":"wgc-q0275","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-3e0f9aeb5d0f62e60b75","layer":"original","quote":"吴人大喜，遭将全怿、全端、唐咨、王祚等，率三万众，密与文钦俱来应诞","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":174,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":33},{"id":"wgc-q0287","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-415a96152140983fb9ca","layer":"original","quote":"大将军乃使反间，以奇变说全怿等〖4〗；怿等率众数千人，开门来出","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":98,"end":129},{"id":"wgc-q0434","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-19a57525c37bf4f5767a","layer":"original","quote":"琮子怿、孙静、从子端、翩、缉等，皆将兵来救诞","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":455,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":92,"end":114},{"id":"wgc-q0437","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-19a57525c37bf4f5767a","layer":"original","quote":"怿等恐惧，遂将所领，开东城门出降，皆蒙封宠，城中由是乖离","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":455,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":204,"end":232}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
